---------------</p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></p><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(53, 53, 53); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial,sans-serif;\">&gt;&gt;&nbsp;전시현장을 찾기 어려운 분들을 위해 영상 콘텐츠로 <span style=\"color: rgb(204, 114, 61);\">&nbsp;</span><strong><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(204, 114, 61);\">&lt;4</span><span style=\"color: rgb(204, 114, 61);\">월&nbsp;양화선</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(204, 114, 61);\">&nbsp;(온라인)초대전&gt;</span></strong></strong>을&nbsp;</span><font face=\"Arial\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 53, 53);\"><font color=\"#333333\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 53, 53);\"><font color=\"#333333\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,sans-serif;\">공개합니다. </span></font></span></span></font></span></span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.5;\"></p><font face=\"Arial\"><font color=\"#333333\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 53, 53);\"><font color=\"#333333\"><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 53, 53);\"><font color=\"#333333\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 53, 53);\"><font color=\"#333333\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,sans-serif;\"><br></span></span></font></span></span></span></font></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 53, 53);\"><font color=\"#333333\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\"